stripe-sigma-schema
===================

This is an UNOFFICIAL, community-maintained reference for the Stripe Sigma data
schema. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Stripe, Inc.

"Stripe", "Stripe Sigma", "Stripe Radar", "Stripe Connect", "Stripe Treasury",
